A move needs no right on the shares.
A capability narrowed to read shares would move their budget all the same;
a share's budget moves only through a capability to it with RIGHT_W.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-grain32 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call moved budget to or from a share its caller could not move it on

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -563,9 +563,6 @@ static int op_share(struct thread *t, uint32_t slot, const struct cap *cap,
         return KERR_OK;
     }
     case OP_SHARE_MOVE: {
-        if (!(cap->rights & RIGHT_W)) {
-            return KERR_NO_RIGHTS;
-        }
         if (arg[1] >= cap->b || arg[2] >= cap->b) {
             return KERR_INVALID_ARG;
         }
